Description:You are at 3 life. The opponent's Mass of Ghouls (5/3) is attacking you. You control a tapped Stormwild Capridor (1/3; noncombat damage to it becomes +1/+1 counters), a tapped Darksteel Myr and a Plains, and have Gideon's Sacrifice in hand. End the turn at 3 life with Stormwild Capridor on the battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-4f52d03909bfa8fe | A redirection changes only who is dealt the damage, not its kind (CR 614.9): redirected combat damage is still combat damage
